00:10:53.387 --> 00:10:54.968
shake hands, kiss babies,

00:10:54.968 --> 00:10:56.593
scare red-headed dudes,

00:10:56.593 --> 00:11:00.726
I think that you need to go
out and put out great stuff

00:11:00.726 --> 00:11:02.026
and let people come to you.

00:11:02.026 --> 00:11:03.610
Let your work speak for itself.

00:11:03.610 --> 00:11:05.637
I would work in a B2B
Environment and try to get

00:11:05.637 --> 00:11:09.027
your work seen in other
places except your blog.

00:11:09.027 --> 00:11:11.636
That can be done behind your keyboard,

00:11:11.636 --> 00:11:14.852
on email to blogs and
news sites that cover

00:11:14.852 --> 00:11:16.511
the arena that you play in.

00:11:16.511 --> 00:11:17.835
That would be my advice to you.

00:11:17.835 --> 00:11:19.017
Let it come to you.

00:11:19.017 --> 00:11:20.688
(car engines revving)

00:11:20.688 --> 00:11:22.314
Cool.

00:11:22.314 --> 00:11:26.012
