all of you more and more

00:11:35.419 --> 00:11:37.044
and more and more.

00:11:37.044 --> 00:11:40.426
So, in detail, Vayner Nation,

00:11:40.426 --> 00:11:43.375
what is your 4th of July plans?

00:11:43.375 --> 00:11:45.000
You keep asking questions,

00:11:45.000 --> 00:11:46.834
I'll keep answering them.

00:11:46.834 --> 00:11:48.744
(car engines revving)

00:11:48.744 --> 00:11:50.999
Awesome. Did you capture
